{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Xj6fENXJqf1795610155.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共總書記習近平對黨內法規工作作出重要指示，要求推進全面從嚴治黨。</p><p></p><p>全國黨內法規工作會議周二至周三在北京召開。會上傳達習近平重要指示，指五年來，中共中央推進依規治黨，黨內法規制度建設成效明顯。</p><p></p><p>要堅持將依規治黨當作管黨治黨基本方式，持續高質量推進黨內法規制度建設，要更加注重制度執行，更加注重黨內法規與國家法律法規銜接協調，為持之以恆推進全面從嚴治黨等提供更有力制度保障。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T13:43:56.932185+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T19:48:01.044890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T13:37:18.882022+00:00","content_hash":"f8b10fb0258ca396dbb224250b8f2a7b46d2b8fd28a0d321a3ad50c715d6771b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T13:43:56.932185+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}